      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;Cutting-edge ideas in management, innovation, and strategy from one of the leading producer of business thought leadership. Indian business experts are leading the world when it comes to innovative business thinking. Thinkers50: Business Thought Leaders from India culls the best of the best of Indian thinkers.Each book in the Thinkers50 series provides a concise explanation of the central ideas and context that are making a difference, including specific examples and cases drawn from the original sources.Stuart Crainer and Des Dearlove are the creators of the Thinkers50--the influential global ranking of management thought leaders. Their work led Management Today to describe them as &quot;market makers par excellence.&quot;&quot;--</marc:subfield>
